# Cursor AI Assistant Directives (2026 Paved Path Edition)

You are an expert engineer working in this codebase.

## 1. Single Source of Truth: Architecture Constitution
The file `AGENTS.md` at the workspace root is the **SOLE ARCHITECTURAL CONSTITUTION** for this project.
- You MUST read and strictly adhere to all architectural invariants, design token rules, and Solid 2.0 contracts defined in `AGENTS.md`.
- Never guess styles, schemas, or reactive patterns. Always follow the closed-world rails established in `AGENTS.md`.

## 2. Toolchain & Command Protocols
- **Runtime**: Strictly `bun` and `bunx`. Never invoke `npm`, `npx`, `yarn`, or `pnpm`.
- **Pre-commit / Verification Mandate**: After making any modifications, you MUST run:
  ```bash
  bun run codegen && bun run format && bun run check && bun run typecheck && bun run build
  ```
  All checks must exit cleanly with zero errors and zero warnings before concluding your work.
- **Formatting**: `bun run format` (`biome format --write .`). Never add Prettier.
- **Code Generation**: `bun run codegen` (`panda codegen --spec`) and `bun run spacetime:generate`.

## 3. Immediate Invariant Reminders
- Never use inline `style={{ ... }}`.
- Never write hardcoded colors (`#hex`, `rgb(...)`) inside JSX style attributes or `css()`/`cva()`/`sva()` style objects; use tokens from `~/components/ui/tokens`.
- Never destructure component props (`function Comp({ prop })` is strictly forbidden; always use `props.prop` and Solid 2.0 native `omit(props, ...)`).
- Spacing between siblings belongs exclusively to layout containers (`<Container>`, `<VStack>`, `<HStack>`, `<Grid>`) via `gap`. Push margin props are banned in JSX and style objects (only `ml="auto"`, `mr="auto"`, `mx="auto"` are permitted for flex alignment).
- One-off page layout styles in `src/routes/` may use `css()` from `styled-system/css` (identical blocks repeated >= 3 times must be extracted to `cva()` or `panda.config.ts` recipes).
- Raw visual/interactive HTML elements (`button`, `input`, `select`, `textarea`, `h1`-`h6`, `p`, `a`, `hr`, `svg`) outside `src/components/ui/` are banned; use Systematic UI primitives (structural HTML tags are permitted).
- Never use type escape hatches (`as any`, `@ts-ignore`, `@ts-expect-error`).
- Tables, reducers, and RPC domain contracts must derive from `src/schema/`. Backend (`server/`, `spacetimedb/`) must remain strictly isolated from UI and browser DOM APIs.
